<title>FINLAND: Partek 1996 profit, sales by division.</title>
<headline>Partek 1996 profit, sales by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish building materials and cargo handling equipment group Partek Oy Ab gave the following breakdown by division of its 1996 results (million markka):</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT	    1996		  1995</p>
<p> Minerals			 147		   138</p>
<p> Cargotec		   loss 25		   151 profit</p>
<p> Insulation		     101		    68</p>
<p> Pre-cast concrete	    108		   105</p>
<p> Other				6		    55 loss</p>
<p>NET SALES</p>
<p> Minerals			 976		   867</p>
<p> Cargotec		     2,169		 2,308</p>
<p> Insulation		   1,341		 1,204</p>
<p> Pre-cast concrete	  1,654		 1,856</p>
<p> Other			     35		   338</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
